# Per-machine tool permissions. Auto-generated, and records host addresses
# (e.g. the Judge0 VM's public IP) that should not be in a public repo.
.claude/

# Reference solutions for every coding question — i.e. the answer key.
# These are the source form the committed question files are generated from
# (see backend/scripts/compute-expected.ts). Keeping them out of a public repo
# means a student cannot read a working solution to every problem.
#
# NOTE: the generated files under data/questions/ still contain hidden test
# cases with their expected outputs. That is enough to hardcode answers, so
# before this platform serves real students the whole bank should move out of
# the repository. See docs/phase-log/phase-6-coding-rounds.md.
data/questions/drafts/
